          "distinct": false,
          "id": "9984288b9e00a33121be418835b7b16f340f1fb8",
          "message": "feat(sparq-kb): USE-3 citation renderer — render prov:wasDerivedFrom citations beside canned-query answers (sq-2489d.11) [SONNET-4.6] (#1861)\n\nImplements sq-2489d.11: the PKG-native citation renderer that makes\n'provenance is load-bearing' (#1110) a shipped, measured feature rather\nthan an aspiration.\n\nquery::citations::render_citations() takes a FINDING_PROVENANCE QueryResult\nand the live Graph, renders each prov:wasDerivedFrom binding as a\n[source: label] (section-anchor) line, and returns a CitationReport with:\n- CitationMetrics.citation_resolution_rate() — target 1.0\n- CitationMetrics.fabricated_count — target 0, MEASURED not assumed\n\nInvariant: every rendered [source] citation resolves to a real\nprov:wasDerivedFrom triple in the graph dictionary (resolution-rate 1.0).\nThe fabricated-citation harness is non-vacuous: the detector test verifies\nit goes RED when an IRI absent from the dictionary is injected.\n\nGate results (both feature states):\n- cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings: GREEN (OFF + ON)\n- cargo test -p sparq-kb: GREEN (feature OFF: 0 tests, as before)\n- cargo test -p sparq-kb --features query --lib: GREEN (17 tests, +7 new\n  unit tests in citations::tests)\n- cargo test -p sparq-kb --features query --test citations: GREEN (3 tests:\n  positive/negative/real-PKG metric harness)\n- RUSTDOCFLAGS=\"-D warnings\" cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --all-features: GREEN\n- python3 scripts/check-readme-template.py --enforce: 0 deviations, 52 READMEs\n\nReal-PKG metric (fixture + real ingest): resolution-rate = 1.0, fabricated = 0.\n\nUnblocks sq-2489d.6 (Phase-7 A/B needs a consumer to compare).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <jw896977@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:41:39Z",
          "tree_id": "0d632e9ae62798d16e0a1bfd849959169ecb4d47",
          "url": "https://github.com/sparq-org/sparq/commit/9984288b9e00a33121be418835b7b16f340f1fb8"
